Subject: [PATCH 14/37] Belobug's ambient light refinements on #917's stand-in
 (beloooo, VIctory-Belobug-AMD 4ffc4766 cd9f78ce 44dcd437 c3bd5612)

VICTORY_AMBIENT_TINT, VICTORY_AMBIENT_SHADE (depth-based crease/contact shading),
VICTORY_AMBIENT_FILE live tuning (diagnostics), reflections held to the ambient light
(CS_UpdateHistory) with a least reflection light. ambient.rs taken from c3bd5612 and fitted:
